@startuml dataflow_review_publish_pipeline
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam SequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam SequenceParticipantBorderColor #555555
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #999999

title Luồng dữ liệu: Review & Publish Pipeline\n(Human-in-the-loop -> Outbox -> Graph Sync)

actor "Giảng viên" as GV
participant "Next.js UI\nReview Inbox" as Web
participant "core-api" as Core
database "PostgreSQL\ncards + quiz + outbox" as PG
queue "Redis\nBullMQ" as Redis
participant "Outbox\nPoller" as Outbox
participant "graph-sync worker" as GraphWorker
database "Neo4j\nKnowledge Graph" as Neo4j

== 1. Review bản nháp ==
GV -> Web : Mở Review Inbox
Web -> Core : GET /review-items\nstatus=GENERATED_DRAFT
Core -> PG : SELECT lesson_cards,\nquiz_items
PG --> Core : drafts[]
Core --> Web : drafts with citations
Web --> GV : Hiển thị card/quiz\nkèm nguồn tham chiếu

== 2. Chỉnh sửa và phê duyệt ==
GV -> Web : Edit / approve / reject
Web -> Core : PATCH /review-items/{id}\ncontent + decision
Core -> PG : UPDATE status\nREVIEWING / APPROVED /\nCHANGES_REQUESTED
Core --> Web : saved

== 3. Publish atomic transaction ==
GV -> Web : Publish
Web -> Core : POST /review-items/{id}/publish
Core -> PG : BEGIN\nUPDATE item status=PUBLISHED\nINSERT outbox_events\nCOMMIT
Core --> Web : {status=PUBLISHED}

note right of PG
  Business update và outbox event
  nằm trong cùng transaction để
  tránh split-brain.
end note

== 4. Đồng bộ đồ thị bất đồng bộ ==
Outbox -> PG : SELECT outbox_events\nWHERE status=PENDING
Outbox -> Redis : enqueue GraphProjectionRequested
GraphWorker -> Redis : consume GraphProjectionRequested
GraphWorker -> PG : LOAD published item\n+ LO mappings
GraphWorker -> Neo4j : MERGE Card/QuizItem\nMERGE relations\n[:EXPLAINS] / [:ASSESSES]
GraphWorker -> PG : UPDATE outbox_events\nstatus=DONE

== 5. Serving cho học viên ==
Web -> Core : GET /published-content
Core -> PG : SELECT PUBLISHED items
Core --> Web : card/quiz ready for learners

@enduml
